/-!
# B-line IL, the `J` kernel (B4), part 3: the dot loop

**`dotP X`**: with the count `c = |cs|` on top of `CNT`, the coefficients `cs ++ R` on the
table stack `dTJ` and the accumulator `acc` (`c ≤ |acc|`) on `X`, it adds `dotF P cs acc` to
the top of `SUM`, moves `cs` (reversed) onto the consumed-table stack `TT` and leaves `X` as it
