rounding `rs P` is linear work (`rsE`: `⌊(2x + 2^P) / 2^{P+1}⌋` by `tdiv` / `tmod` and a sign
test, with the rulers `2^P`, `2^{P+1}` on `rP`, `rP1`). Cost: `(c + 1) · uC Φm Bx Bc`.
-/

